tldtglfak		PROTECT			INPUTRI		10
tldbisnis		PROTECT                 INPUTRI		11


DEFAULTS(tmptrans)
tldlok2                 INIT_ADD        {g_usrkode}
tldlok2                 INIT_UPDATE     {g_usrkode}

EDITS(tmptrans)
e.ValidateppdBrg4 tldbrg VALIDATE brgstsdatbrg mbrg4x sbrg {Pgv_INPG} {Pgv_dtbarang}
/*e.ValidatetbdBrg4 tldlok VALIDATE tbddtmstidx mtbd4x stbdLokAsl {Pgv_dttabel} {Pgv_barang} {PlLOKAHASS} {Pgv_BR} {Ptlmcab}*/

CALCS()
cdscanstokintiall	dscanstokintiall >= 0
curtall			lurtall + 1
cjointld0all		djointldall == 0
cjointld1all		djointldall == 1
cbrgbeda		tldket2 == tldbrg
clokbeda                aktbukoto == tldlok 
csudahscan		tldket2 != BLANKS

MAP(mbrg4x)
brgkode         tldbrg          REPLACE
brgnama         lnamabrg4       REPLACE

/*MAP(mtbd4x)
tbdkode		tldlok		REPLACE
*/
MAP(mmaptldstokintix)
c0		lstokbaranginti	DO_CALC
lstokbaranginti tldperdis7      REPLACE_IF cdscanstokintiall
g_tgltrn	tldtglfak	REPLACE
cstrtime	tldsat		DO_CALC
DEBUG   ldum    ldum            REPLACE

MAP(murtahs2x)
gv_int1		tldnourt	REPLACE_IF cjointld0all
curtall		tldnourt	DO_CALC_IF cjointld1all

HOOKS(tmptrans)
BEFORE_INPUT	cur_field=tldbrg	DO_MAP SHOW murtahs2x
BEFORE_INPUT	cur_field=tldket2	DO_SKIP_IF csudahscan
AFTER_INPUT     cur_field=tldjml        DO_SCAN dscanstokinti
AFTER_INPUT     cur_field=tldjml        DO_MAP SHOW     mmaptldstokintix
AFTER_INPUT     cur_keybd=EN            DO_MAP SHOW     mmaptldstokintix
AFTER_INPUT     cur_field=tldket2      DO_MAP SHOW
                IF cbrgbeda     mdum
                ELSE  HKCURSOR STAY
                HKMSG t.BrgBeda         
AFTER_INPUT     cur_keybd=EN            DO_MAP SHOW
                IF cbrgbeda     mdum
                ELSE  HKCURSOR STAY
                HKMSG t.BrgBeda         


